  "extractionNotes": "Father employed since 2025-09-01 (small employer). Mother self-employed (0510 from 2022-05-15, voluntary sickness), maternity benefit on her account 2026-03-21..2026-07-31 = 19 weeks, after which she gave up the rest of maternity leave in his favour. Father's 1240 title starts 2026-08-01, so his remaining maternity is 2026-08-01..2026-08-07. The mother's statement of non-use covers 2026-08-08..2027-04-02 and excludes the father's 9 weeks; that window is 238 days = 224 days of shared parental + 14 days of paternity leave taken as a break (to be filed on a new form). The ZUS screen search window ends 2027-03-05, which fits a first parental part 2026-08-08..2027-03-05 (210 days), paternity 2027-03-06..19 and a final part 2027-03-20..2027-04-02 (14 days, printed in the employer remark); the split of the first part is inferred. ZUS note: benefit granted as requested; rate not printed. Salary about 53,333 a month with the deduction falling to 3.24% and 2.45% in mid-2026 (annual contribution cap); the monthly amounts are mostly illegible, so months are omitted."
